,title,link,text,language,family
0,Kulisusu language - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kulisusu_language,"Kulisusu is an Austronesian language (one of the Celebic languages) of Southeast Sulawesi, Indonesia. The Kulisusu language is spoken in the northern part of Buton Island. It is part of a dialect chain with two minor languages, Koroni and Taloki.",Kulisusu,Austronesian
1,Kulisusu,https://www.kulisusu.net/index.php/en,"Greetings from the Kulisusu people of Indonesia! This website is about our language and customs. We invite you to select form the menu on the left to learn about our stories, our music, our dances, our games, our food, and our celebrations. Besides information, you will find lots of pictures. We also have material that you can listen to and download. You can also use the tabs at the top of the ...",Kulisusu,Austronesian
