4,Musical Instruments - Kulisusu,https://kulisusu.net/en/our-music/musical-instruments,"The following instruments are traditional or common in the Kulisusu area. Use the links to see pictures, hear sample music, and learn more about each instrument. If no link is available, please check back later since we are continually updating our website.",Kulisusu,Austronesian
5,ABVD: Kulisusu,https://abvd.eva.mpg.de/austronesian/language.php?id=884,"A Database of Basic Austronesian Vocabulary Changed ""silcode"" from """" - Simon Greenhill (2012-01-09 01:28:56) Changed ""notes"" from ""Mead, David. 1999. The Bungku-Tolaki languages of south-eastern Sulawesi, Indonesia. Canberra: Pacific Linguistics D-91. č = voiceless palatal stop/affricate β = voiced/voiceless bilabial fricative β = voiced bilabial fricative"" - Simon Greenhill (2012-01-09 ...",Kulisusu,Austronesian
6,Kulisusu language - Omniglot,https://www.omniglot.com/writing/kulisusu.htm,"Kulisusu (Pogau Kolinsusu) Kulisusu is a Celebic language spoken by about 23,000 people on the island of Buton in the province of Southeast Sulawesi in Indonesia. It is spoken particularly in the districts of North Kulisusu and Kambowa in the North Buton Regency, in the Maligano district of the Muna Regency, and in the South Wawonii and Northeast Wawonii Districts of the Konawe Islands Regency.",Kulisusu,Austronesian
7,Lagu Daerah Kulisusu - Lipu Curuano Reangku Yt= Sahrun Laea ... - TikTok,https://www.tiktok.com/@moronene.culture/video/7417423501478432006,"508 Likes, TikTok video from Moronene culture & history (@moronene.culture): ""Lagu Daerah Kulisusu - Lipu Curuano Reangku Yt= Sahrun Laea Jgn Lupa Scrb #rumpunbungkutolaki #kulinsusu #kulisusu #ereke #kulisusupride🥰 #rumpunbungkutolaki #bungku #tolaki #witamori #moronene #menui #wawonii #padoe #culambatu #butonutara #bombana #konawekepulauan #konawe #konaweutara #konaweselatan #kendari # ...",Kulisusu,Austronesian
8,Austronesian Soundscapes: Performing Arts in Oceania and ... - JSTOR,https://www.jstor.org/stable/j.ctt46mvnd,"Austronesian Soundscapes is a collection of essays on Austronesian musics that transcends disciplinary frontiers in the humanities and social sciences. In all of Austronesia, music plays a crucial role in the negotiation of cultural identities; yet research on the diversity of the Austronesian cultural belt's music has hitherto been rather sparse.",Kulisusu,Austronesian
9,Jurnal Bastra (Bahasa dan Sastra) - bastra.uho.ac.id,https://bastra.uho.ac.id/index.php/journal/article/download/1273/684/3080,"ABSTRACT This research aims to describe the Kulisusu landscape in the text of the Kulisusu North Buton regional song. This type of research is field research and the method used in this research is a descriptive method which aims to describe the research results in detail and in depth. The data used in this research is oral data from the text of the Kulisusu regional song, North Buton Regency ...",Kulisusu,Austronesian
